      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "optical",
        "summary": "Solid-state photoluminescence of the Eu9 cluster at 77 K shows ligand-sensitized bright red Eu3+ emission. The 5D0→7F1 manifold contains six peaks (584–595 nm), consistent with two distinct Eu sites (C2v and D4d), while 5D0→7F0 is a singlet. The excitation spectrum has a broad ligand band plus weak direct Eu3+ peaks.",
